      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Saratoga,_Texas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Saratoga sits within the Big Thicket National Preserve, a dense forest that once supported Native American hunting and gathering.",
